cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  adaptive-teacher: a Claude Code skill for adaptive teaching with a
  persistent learner model
message: >-
  If you use this skill, or the answer-style protocol derived from it,
  please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Su
    given-names: Hang Lu
    alias: homeowmorphism
abstract: >-
  A domain-general Claude Code skill for being taught. It answers clarifying
  questions using an eight-rule, evidence-based answer-style protocol, treats
  every question as a datum about what the learner knows, and maintains a
  persistent learner model so the teaching adapts across sessions. Every rule
  is pinned to the learning-science literature.
keywords:
  - claude-code
  - agent-skill
  - learning-science
  - tutoring
  - learner-model
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://github.com/homeowmorphism/adaptive-teacher"
repository-code: "https://github.com/homeowmorphism/adaptive-teacher"
